# Scratchpad

- Modified `controller/relay.go`: Fallback from `gemini-2.5-pro-exp-03-25` to `gemini-2.0-flash-thinking-exp-01-21` only on specific "quota exceeded" 429 error.
- Modified `service/key_manager.go`: Implemented daily request limit (25/day) per API key using Redis (`common.RDB`).
- Fixed compilation errors in `relay/channel/api_request.go` and `service/key_manager.go` related to `GetAvailableKey` signature and removed `RecordUsage`.
- Added Redis dependency (initially v9, corrected to use existing v8).
- Successfully compiled the project (`go build ./...`).
- Modified `controller/relay.go`: Added Channel ID and Name to logs when specific 429 error occurs (triggering fallback) and logged original error message for general 429 errors.
- Modified `controller/relay.go` and `relay/channel/api_request.go`: Passed API key via context and included masked key in `processChannelError` logs for better traceability.
- Modified `controller/relay.go`: Implemented silent fallback for specific 429 error (quota exceeded) in `Relay` function, removing user-facing error messages and logs related to the fallback action.
- Modified `controller/relay.go`: Implemented fallback to `fallbackModel` on any `http.StatusTooManyRequests` (429) error in `Relay` function, logging a warning for the fallback action. Removed unused variables.
